comment = "DTrace profiling templates with OpenTelemetry output"

desc = <<EOD
bsdinstruments bundles a catalog of DTrace-backed profiling templates
covering system tracing, file and network activity, allocations,
scheduler and lock analysis, and USDT-instrumented applications, and
ships the results as text, JSONL, or OTLP/HTTP+JSON to an
OpenTelemetry collector.
EOD
